<title>USA: PSI Energy files $250 mln shelf debt offer.</title>
<headline>PSI Energy files $250 mln shelf debt offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSI Energy Inc filed a shelf registration on Tuesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $250 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>Net proceeds from the offering will be used to redeem, purchase, repay or retire outstanding debt and preferred stock, the Cincinnati, Ohio-based company said.</p>
<p>The company, a unit of Cinergy Corp, did not list underwriters.</p>
